ind":"announcement","title":"Dev log #2: Shaping the lands through Leshen Magic","summary":"Hello everyone! We're currently preparing to wrap up our spell system design, which has become quite robust with features. We have everything from rocks, different trees, light-binding totems, and eight different flowers to shape the island how you want. The island looks very different depending on how you shape it! Our goal was to give you, the player, as many options as possible, while not becoming too unwieldly in the options. You'll be able to make use of over a dozen spells, with the main l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-30T02:13:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155566670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3674070-1827626365769130","game_id":"steam-3674070","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog #1 - What is Iona’s Island?","summary":"Hi everyone,Since this is our first blog entry, before we dive into the story and mechanics of the game, we’d like to give you a brief overview of what Iona’s Island is about.At its heart, Iona’s Island is a game meant to help players relax as they explore the island. There’s a sense of charm and wonder in everything you do on the Island, and you can play completely at your own pace. You’ll be able to enjoy the game while uncovering mysteries, or just enjoy the relaxing lofi beats in the backgro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T22:19:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365769130","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3674070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:41:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T